WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:08.240
The night before the boycott, one little woman asked to speak.

2
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:15.380
She got up and gave a very stirring speech, that she had an old raggedy car,

3
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:20.640
and she would run it until you couldn’t run it any more.

4
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:30.660
That morning at five o’clock we were all in place with our automobiles ready to accept the challenge.
